  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ShowroomController
  spaceships:
  - name: Default Ship
    subtitle: 'Playable Class: Terran Interceptor (Standard Issue)'
    description: The backbone of the United Earth Defense Fleet. This standard-issue
      interceptor is highly balanced, offering recruits a reliable and stable platform
      to begin their career. Equipped with twin pulse cannons, standard shield generators,
      and a micro-warp thruster, it remains a favorite among veterans for its handling
      and predictable performance in dense asteroid fields.
    stats: 'Speed: 12.0 (Balanced)

      Dash Cooldown: 1.5 Seconds

      Hull
      Integrity: Standard (3 HP)

      Primary Arsenal: Twin Pulse Cannons

      Special
      Attribute: High Maneuverability & Agile Braking

      Projectile Type: Standard
      Player Laser (Blue)'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5c182baa006d5ec4b88812df5d242ed5, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3193e56089773804faade7836d5c9a12, type: 3}
  - name: Iron Vanguard
    subtitle: 'Playable Class: Heavy Vanguard Juggernaut'
    description: Designed for frontline breakthrough operations, the Iron Vanguard
      is a heavily armored warship capable of weathering intense enemy fire. It trades
      speed for raw defensive power and is armed with prototype heavy kinetic shell
      launchers that deal massive impact damage. Its titanium-reinforced hull allows
      it to shrug off collisions that would vaporize lighter fighters.
    stats: 'Speed: 9.5 (Heavy Armored)

      Dash Cooldown: 1.8 Seconds

      Hull
      Integrity: Reinforced (4 HP)

      Primary Arsenal: Kinetic Shell Cannon

      Special
      Attribute: Frontal Defense Shielding

      Projectile Type: Heavy Kinetic
      Bolt (Orange)'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f89f705d4ba20d9449e1080e8a623b46, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2243d23f0da049f4ab41c8f927342cb6, type: 3}
  - name: Nova Prism
    subtitle: 'Playable Class: Energy Assault Cruiser'
    description: A state-of-the-art prototype vessel powered by raw stellar energy
      crystals. The Nova Prism projects concentrated energy bolts in wide sweeping
      arcs, allowing the pilot to clear large formations of enemy ships simultaneously.
      While its shields require significant power to maintain, its offensive coverage
      is unmatched.
    stats: 'Speed: 11.5 (Energy Cruiser)

      Dash Cooldown: 1.4 Seconds

      Hull
      Integrity: Standard (3 HP)

      Primary Arsenal: Wide-Arc Energy Crystal

      Special
      Attribute: Wide Spread Projectile Coverage

      Projectile Type: Prism Scatter
      Laser (Teal)'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6287f3b68cbbb3448bb40ffb3cfc6146, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0b1797ebdc970d346ac210e7bf2fddf4, type: 3}
  - name: Shadow Wraith
    subtitle: 'Playable Class: Tactical Stealth Fighter'
    description: Developed for deep-space espionage and assassination runs, the Shadow
      Wraith utilizes a cloaking field generator to slip past enemy radars. It fires
      high-velocity phantom rounds that bypass minor physical shields. Its lightweight
      chassis and overcharged thrusters make it incredibly agile, though its hull
      is relatively fragile.
    stats: 'Speed: 13.0 (Espionage Class)

      Dash Cooldown: 1.2 Seconds

      Hull
      Integrity: Lightweight (2 HP)

      Primary Arsenal: Phantom Bolt Launcher

      Special
      Attribute: Phase Dash & Reduced Hitbox

      Projectile Type: Purple Phantom
      Bolt (Purple)'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a993d47853336664f95ff525790d2bab, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 83e3cd133591d0d40b11fb21b402c2c0, type: 3}
  - name: Star Swift
    subtitle: 'Playable Class: Ultra-Speed Reconnaissance Vessel'
    description: Built on a lightweight carbon-nanotube chassis and equipped with
      experimental antimatter thrusters, the Star Swift is the fastest ship in the
      fleet. It is capable of executing lightning-fast dash maneuvers with minimal
      cooldown. It fires rapid-fire photon bursts, overwhelming enemies with a continuous
      barrage of light.
    stats: 'Speed: 15.0 (Extreme Recon)

      Dash Cooldown: 1.0 Seconds

      Hull
      Integrity: Lightweight (2 HP)

      Primary Arsenal: Rapid Photon Gatling

      Special
      Attribute: Hyper-Speed Thruster Boost

      Projectile Type: Rapid Photon
      Burst (Yellow)'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 16fb1566d0253474c95e5ae459035f52, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0831b73aa37795345af191ec588185cc, type: 3}
  arsenal:
  - name: Repair Kit
    subtitle: Nanotech Repair Module
    description: Deploys localized nanite swarms to instantly patch up structural
      breaches and restore spaceship hull integrity. This module is vital for surviving
      long skirmishes inside enemy territory, converting scrap metal and cosmic debris
      into functional armor plating.
    stats: 'Hull Restoration: +1 Health Unit

      Target System: Armor/Hull Integrity

      Activation:
      Instantaneous on pickup

      Cooldown: N/A'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64928f620836c994a922ef9dfcb04fa8, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Energy Shield
    subtitle: Hyper-Frequency Deflector Shield
    description: Generates a bubble of polarized plasma around the ship's hull. The
      deflector shield is tuned to absorb one incoming projectile or physical collision
      of any magnitude, shattering after impact to dissipate the energy safely away
      from the ship.
    stats: 'Shield Capacity: 1 Active Charge

      Duration: Unlimited until broken

      Target
      System: Defensive Grid

      Activation: Automatic protection'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7dd11da620846ad44b4466676b607092, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Triple Fire Upgrade
    subtitle: Weapon System Matrix Upgrade
    description: Overclocks the ship's primary weapon capacitor, routing power to
      two additional diagonal firing ports. This upgrade significantly increases
      the ship's damage output and horizontal area coverage, allowing the pilot to
      suppress incoming fleets.
    stats: 'Firing Lanes: 3 Simultaneous (Spread)

      Target System: Weapon Matrix

      Duration:
      Level/Wave duration

      Damage Output: Triple coverage'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f0128ae0822f02d4d91002ed1dd5c586, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Mega Bomb
    subtitle: Anti-Matter Field Disrupter
    description: Releases a highly unstable anti-matter wave that expands outward
      from the player's ship. The resulting shockwave instantly vaporizes all minor
      enemy vessels and neutralizes all active enemy projectiles within the local
      sector, providing a critical reset.
    stats: 'Blast Radius: Screen-wide clearing

      Target System: Tactical Payload

      Damage:
      Ultimate Area Damage

      Special Effect: Bullet deletion'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c20654fd12ca7d541a4efdf91bd36a56, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Thruster Spark
    subtitle: Temporal Speed Booster
    description: Injects highly refined hypergolic fuel directly into the ship's
      thruster chambers. This temporarily boosts sub-light speed, increases dash
      acceleration, and reduces dash cooldown times, allowing the pilot to weave
      through bullet hell patterns.
    stats: 'Velocity Increase: +25% Speed boost

      Duration: 8.0 Seconds

      Target
      System: Propulsion/Thrusters

      Dash Cooldown Reduction: -30%'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 64eabeb72d02c2e488c37046dd8f15fb, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Item Magnet
    subtitle: Gravitational Harvester Field
    description: Activates a low-frequency gravitational pull that draws all floating
      items, power-ups, and scrap metal within the sector directly towards the ship.
      This allows the pilot to focus entirely on dodging hostile fire while collecting
      resources.
    stats: 'Attraction Range: Sector-wide pull

      Duration: 10.0 Seconds

      Target
      System: Auxiliary Utility

      Pull Velocity: Progressive acceleration'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ceaedc34cd9d9f047a9b8c1b0e579e47, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Score Booster
    subtitle: Quantum Point Multiplier
    description: Calibrates the ship's telemetry systems to double all points received
      for a short duration. Essential for pilot ranking optimization and breaking
      high score records.
    stats: 'Multiplier: 2x Score Multiplier

      Duration: 10.0 Seconds

      Target
      System: Score Telemetry

      Activation: Instantaneous on pickup'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1f9846e2a6c15d8419b9f19166ba993d, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 0}
  enemies:
  - name: Drone Scout
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-I Light Scout Ship'
    description: Mass-produced scout drones deployed by the enemy vanguard. While
      they lack heavy shields or weapons, they attack in high-speed, synchronized
      swarms, attempting to overwhelm defensive lines through numbers and flanking
      maneuvers.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 10 HP

      Threat Level: Green (Low)

      Weapon
      Class: Light Plasma Cannon

      Scoring Value: 10,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: Standard Red Laser'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ceeacec592d8d9e4b81c6db45a71e905, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 95c138d3eb67a42469d8659069f14efa, type: 3}
  - name: Aegis Guardian
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-II Heavy Escort'
    description: Equipped with dense forward shielding, the Aegis Guardian is designed
      to protect vulnerable scout units. It slowly drifts forward, absorbing oncoming
      attacks and returning fire with slow but high-yield energy spheres.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 30 HP

      Threat Level: Green (Low)

      Weapon
      Class: Teal Energy Orb

      Scoring Value: 30,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: Teal Plasma Sphere'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c8f5d26e47729d445b126e4e14ac9570, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65cca655b36e8944faa9d5a0d4286398, type: 3}
  - name: Harvester Curved
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-I Resource Gatherer'
    description: A swift resource harvester repurposed for frontline combat. It moves
      in sweeping, curved patterns, collecting space debris while deploying hazardous
      biological spore pods to deter pursuit.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 15 HP

      Threat Level: Green (Low)

      Weapon
      Class: Purple Bio-Spore Pods

      Scoring Value: 15,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: Purple Spore Pod'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4322692dbf08d294e83dabbb9481dca8, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bde60751887e31f4dab55409a4255f7b, type: 3}
  - name: Hunter Interceptor
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-II Precision Hunter'
    description: An advanced hunter-killer ship designed to track and eliminate key
      target vessels. Outfitted with high-yield sniper lasers and searchlight sensors,
      it tracks the player's movement and fires high-velocity energy beams with extreme
      precision.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 50 HP

      Threat Level: Orange (Medium)

      Weapon
      Class: Red Energy Spike

      Scoring Value: 25,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: Red Plasma Spike'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9b5f275d4210a3140a4e801550ab073e, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c98f95e787311ee45a4c20707555b158, type: 3}
  - name: Pulse Ray
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-III Sniper Ray'
    description: A long-range specialist utilizing focused cyan laser emitters. The
      Pulse Ray hovers at the top of the sector, locking onto the player's coordinates
      before releasing continuous high-velocity sniper beams.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 50 HP

      Threat Level: Orange (Medium)

      Weapon
      Class: Cyan Sniper Beam

      Scoring Value: 50,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: High-Velocity Cyan Beam'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 202fce700d6f7ea439bef4bcf9221957, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: dffa9f5948a0361499aa28dc3fae30c7, type: 3}
  - name: Void Stinger
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-III Heavy Stinger'
    description: An aggressive, fast-moving fighter that dives towards the player
      ship. Its stinger-shaped weapon matrix fires multiple dense plasma spikes to
      restrict the player's flight paths.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 60 HP

      Threat Level: Orange (Medium)

      Weapon
      Class: Red Energy Spike

      Scoring Value: 60,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: Red Plasma Spike'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ecef8a5f3f6be3745a6d6ca2799a5fba, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c98f95e787311ee45a4c20707555b158, type: 3}
  - name: Proximity Space Mine
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-III Tactical Hazard'
    description: Heavy space mines deployed to block choke points and asteroid paths.
      When detonated by proximity or weapon fire, they release a deadly burst of
      high-velocity physical shrapnel that inflicts massive damage to any nearby
      hulls.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 30 HP (Obstacle)

      Threat Level: Yellow (Caution)

      Weapon
      Class: Contact Shrapnel Blast

      Scoring Value: 5,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: None'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 0}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - name: Gargantuan Command Ship - Phase I
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-V Boss Dreadnought (Stationary)'
    description: The flagship of the invading alien fleet. In its first phase, the
      colossal vessel remains stationary, firing focused heavy energy spheres directly
      at the player. Its massive shields deflect all minor attacks.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 30,000,000 HP

      Threat Level: Red (Critical)

      Weapon
      Class: Heavy aimed plasma spheres

      Scoring Value: 1,000,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: Orange Boss Plasma Phase 1'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e87dbe486412c62448abeb59751d97b2, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe02af5809fcaed43a4e04a0d5bf2a35, type: 3}
  - name: Gargantuan Command Ship - Phase II
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-V Boss Dreadnought (Strafing)'
    description: Once its armor is damaged past 66% HP, the Command Ship begins to
      strafe horizontally across the sector. It overclocks its primary weapon capacitor,
      significantly increasing its rate of fire.
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 20,000,000 HP

      Threat Level: Red (Critical)

      Weapon
      Class: Overclocked strafing plasma

      Scoring Value: 1,000,000 Points

      Projectile
      Type: Orange Boss Plasma Phase 2'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2cec14ba8f925cd4a82c545c581564c5, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e00b5a076d203b949ae7b3e0288150be, type: 3}
  - name: Gargantuan Command Ship - Phase III
    subtitle: 'Threat Class: Class-V Boss Dreadnought (Overdrive)'
    description: "Operating under 33% HP, the Boss enters overdrive. It moves at
      maximum speed, deploys twin escort drones, and fires a devastating wide 3-bullet
      spread spanning \xB115 degrees, saturating the entire flight space."
    stats: 'Hull Integrity: 10,000,000 HP

      Threat Level: Red (Critical)

      Weapon
      Class: Triple Spread Plasma & Drone Escort

      Scoring Value: 1,000,000
      Points

      Projectile Type: Orange Boss Plasma Phase 3'
    mainSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: df01c3aaf999557439725f1a145ee82e, type: 3}
    extraSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a9027660437b014eaee8b585de665ce, type: 3}
  itemNameText: {fileID: 958412087}
  itemSubtitleText: {fileID: 705667437}
